{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787393675026195001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"wordy-clerical-pipit","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"22a4c953c3b77b57629d2b70600cfbd840dbacd9600ec7e0ddda8c9d98894387","event_uuid":"e7442ad6-8478-4e7f-a552-52e419cf4936","position":{"commit_sha":"6a18e8541e096cb8a9071fa4b7ea4c9de4d1a263","position":"1787386183065308001-e7442ad6-8478-4e7f-a552-52e419cf4936"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"6fc9292d828f4627363949e7dea26f6e6225cb23cb61d71accbcf7d00b8b6d60","event_uuid":"bbfa954a-2150-4d96-a871-590288782a16","position":{"commit_sha":"6212e60ca8e897318135cbec7d3d526f8cdb5920","position":"1787386238567615001-bbfa954a-2150-4d96-a871-590288782a16"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787386183065308001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"bbfa954a-2150-4d96-a871-590288782a16","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"2c66-205d-92e1-4419"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nS7 (2c66-205d-92e1-4419) emits the echo-safe parent-drift breadcrumb from `outbound_comments._diff_comments`, appended after the resolved Jira dedup set is built. In the **snapshot path** (production's primary source — the snapshot carries the `comment` field) this works even when the child has zero local comments. But in the **live-search path** (snapshot lacks the `comment` field), `_diff_comments` early-returns `[]` at the `if not local_comments:` guard (outbound_comments.py ~line 635) BEFORE `_build_parent_breadcrumb` is reached. So a drift-affected child with no local comments — exactly the under-defined-leaf case the breadcrumb targets — gets no breadcrumb in that fallback path.\n\nRaised as a non-blocking advisory on Gerrit change 2091 (S7 LLM review).\n\n## Why deferred from S7\n\nThe narrow safe fix is: in the live-search path, when `not local_comments` but a client IS available and the drift condition may apply, still fetch comments (for the append-once dedup) and emit the breadcrumb. The client-None and fetch-failed returns must stay (bug-4292 safety: never blind-add when Jira comment state is unknown). Implementing this inline adds a branch to `_diff_comments`, which is already at the McCabe complexity ceiling (the S7 implementer used `mutations.extend(...)` specifically to avoid tripping the ratchet). A correct fix therefore needs a behavior-preserving extraction, too large to fold safely into the S7 landing.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A drift-affected bound child with zero local comments and an available transport client receives exactly one breadcrumb in the live-search path (snapshot lacks `comment`), append-once against the live-fetched comment set.\n- [ ] The client-None and live-fetch-failure paths still emit no breadcrumb (bug-4292 unknown-state safety preserved).\n- [ ] `_diff_comments` stays under the complexity ratchet (fix via extraction, not a baseline bump).","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"9ebb-3114-4d0e-4528","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Parent-drift breadcrumb skipped in live-search path when child has no local comments","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e7442ad6-8478-4e7f-a552-52e419cf4936","bbfa954a-2150-4d96-a871-590288782a16"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787393675026195001,"uuid":"9925bad9-df51-4010-9f3a-b853b646c46f"}